msgstr "BPMN Permissions Description"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/ecos_bpmn_permissions.rst:158
msgid "Идентификатор"
msgstr "Identifier"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/ecos_bpmn_permissions.rst:159
msgid "Название"
msgstr "Name"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/ecos_bpmn_permissions.rst:160
msgid "Описание"
msgstr "Description"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/ecos_bpmn_permissions.rst:161
msgid "**read**"
msgstr "**read**"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/ecos_bpmn_permissions.rst:162
msgid "Право на чтение (read)"
msgstr "Read permission (read)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/ecos_bpmn_permissions.rst:163
msgid ""
"Чтение раздела или модели с учётом итоговых разрешений и правил рабочего "
"пространства."
msgstr "Read access to a section or model, subject to effective permissions and workspace rules."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/ecos_bpmn_permissions.rst:164
msgid "**write**"
msgstr "**write**"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/ecos_bpmn_permissions.rst:165
msgid "Право на изменение (write)"
msgstr "Write permission (write)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/ecos_bpmn_permissions.rst:166
msgid ""
"Запись раздела или модели. Право раздела также участвует в предоставлении"
" записи вложенным моделям; создание и публикация проверяются отдельно."
msgstr "Write access to a section or model. The section permission also contributes to granting write access to nested models; creation and deployment are checked separately."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/ecos_bpmn_permissions.rst:167
msgid "**bpmn-section-create-process-def**"
msgstr "**bpmn-section-create-process-def**"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/ecos_bpmn_permissions.rst:168
msgid "Создание процессов в разделе"
msgstr "Create processes in section"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/ecos_bpmn_permissions.rst:169
msgid "Можно ли создавать новые процессы в разделе."
msgstr "Whether new processes can be created in the section"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/ecos_bpmn_permissions.rst:170
msgid "**bpmn-section-create-subsection**"
msgstr "**bpmn-section-create-subsection**"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/ecos_bpmn_permissions.rst:171
msgid "Создание подразделов"
msgstr "Create subsections"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/ecos_bpmn_permissions.rst:172
msgid "Можно ли создавать подразделы внутри раздела."
msgstr "Whether subsections can be created within the section"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/ecos_bpmn_permissions.rst:173
msgid "**bpmn-section-edit-process-def**"
msgstr "**bpmn-section-edit-process-def**"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/ecos_bpmn_permissions.rst:174
msgid "Редактирование процессов в разделе"
msgstr "Edit processes in section"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/ecos_bpmn_permissions.rst:175
msgid ""
"Позволяет редактировать модели в разделе без обязательного права write на"
" сам раздел. Не заменяет разрешение создавать новые модели."
msgstr "Allows editing models in a section without necessarily having write permission on the section itself. Does not replace permission to create new models."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/ecos_bpmn_permissions.rst:176
msgid "**bpmn-process-def-deploy**"
msgstr "**bpmn-process-def-deploy**"

